{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他更清楚自己想要的不只是眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不只是眼前亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想尽情对对方好，也盼对方同样珍惜他，想知道两人若都愿意靠近，能有多幸福。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜他\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"愿望涌来，他觉得有好多喜欢可给、亲近可珍惜，仿佛什么都不缺，幸福得几乎招架不住，连自己都顾不上。\",\n      \"key\": \"几乎招架不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的亲近让他暂时顾不上那份没着落的盼望，只想尽情享受这一刻。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽情享受这一刻\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"text\": \"对方还没有给他新的保证，他想被同样珍惜的愿望仍没着落。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿望仍没着落\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他更清楚自己想要什么的过渡，不重复前段已经成立的心理过程，并改用S11-1作为直接前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把温柔有归处和共同幸福改成具体的愿望：想尽情给予、想被同样珍惜，也想知道两人能共享怎样的幸福。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\", \"S12-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留有喜欢可给、有亲近可珍惜的丰沛感，以及幸福强烈到几乎招架不住、自我暂时退后的体验；另列没有新保证这一限制，避免把愿望涌现误写成愿望已经实现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R56\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"用眼前的亲近暂时压过没着落的盼望，具体说明他为何此刻不想盘算以后，同时保留缺憾仍在、当下却不受它折磨的状态。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "16cf021e-2c17-4a5d-9b17-28d557e83ee2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T110339385436Z", "elapsed_seconds": 879.407, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T11:18:18.812552+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a13f777376ece76fa83d22d52727b8d3d255cbca85baceb4fafd90a8f25a2b09", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T110339385436Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8687d7a147df6567cc09241b70a80abc8c5d7d43efa7a99b230e25c6a840f8d3"}}